---
import "../../../v2/document.css";
import "../../../v2/workbench.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="light">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Greenways v2 foundations laboratory</title>
  </head>
  <body class="gw-v2 gw-v2-document">
    <main class="gw-v2-page">
      <section class="gw-v2-surface">
        <p>Foundation contract · Issue #33</p>
        <h1>Neutral structure. Peacock identity.</h1>
        <p>The foundation laboratory verifies the visual language before application surfaces are built.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="gw-v2-grid">
        <article class="gw-v2-surface">
          <h2>Light surface</h2>
          <p>Paper, stone, charcoal, neutral seams.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="gw-v2-surface" data-elevation="raised">
          <h2>Dark surface</h2>
          <p>Graphite, slate, soft white, restrained accents.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="gw-v2-surface">
          <h2>Brand accents</h2>
          <p>Emerald, aqua, sapphire and violet belong to the mark and signals.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
